<#ff7a30>GUN FLAME FEINT</>
Gun Flame		^X
  A wave of fire along the ground. Cancels from normals.
Gun Flame Feint		_B^X
  Or hold ^X. A fake Gun Flame. Its recovery cancels into
  specials, supers, grab, Gun Flame or another feint.

<#ff7a30>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves
  him open.
Grab		^Y
  _B^Y throws backwards. Works in the air too.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second
  cooldown.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B

<#ff7a30>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Command Normals		_F^A / _F^C / _DF^C
Dust (launcher)		^B_+^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Air Dive Kick		_D^C (air)
  Chains light to heavy, standing into crouching.

<#ff7a30>SPECIALS</>
Volcanic Viper (ground/air)		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
  Knockdown (during air Viper)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Bandit Revolver (ground/air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  Bandit Bringer		hold the button (ground)
Sidewinder (air)		_D_DF_F^C
Riot Stamp		_D_DB_B^A / ^B
Grand Viper		_D_DB_B^C
  Mash and move the stick for more hits.
Fafnir		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Wild Throw		_F_DF_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff7a30>SUPERS</>
Tyrant Rave (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Tyrant Rave ver.Beta (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Napalm Death (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
